<title>USA: Discovery Communications 1996 revs $661.8 million.</title>
<headline>Discovery Communications 1996 revs $661.8 million.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discovery Communications Inc, owned by Liberty Media Corp and its three partners, said on Tuesday its 1996 revenues were $661.8 million, with operating cash flow of $70.2 million.</p>
<p>Discovery, the parent company of the Discovery and Learning cable channels, is itself privately held by Liberty, a unit of Tele-Communications Inc ; Cox Communications Inc; Advance/Newhouse Communications; and John Hendricks, Discovery's founder and chief executive.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
